@startuml
title UC10 - Trình tự Tạo phòng học
actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "Flutter UI" as UI
participant "RoomService (client)" as RoomCli
participant "ApiService (client)" as Api
participant "RoomController (server)" as RoomCtrl
participant "RoomService (server)" as RoomSvc
database "MySQL" as DB

User -> UI: Nhập tên phòng, visibility, passcode(optional)
UI -> RoomCli: validate(roomForm)
RoomCli -> Api: POST /rooms
Api -> RoomCtrl: /rooms
RoomCtrl -> RoomSvc: createRoom(dto)
RoomSvc -> DB: INSERT room
DB --> RoomSvc: roomId
RoomSvc --> RoomCtrl: RoomDTO
RoomCtrl --> Api: 201 + RoomDTO
Api --> RoomCli: RoomDTO
RoomCli -> UI: Hiển thị phòng vừa tạo
@enduml